{"seq":1,"slug":"green-delivery-option-taxonomy","title":"绿色配送选项分类与适用边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/carbon-neutral-green-shipping-estimation-options/green-shipping-options/green-delivery-option-taxonomy","wordCount":3216,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"绿色配送选项分类与适用边界\">绿色配送选项分类与适用边界</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一个跨境电商订单的配送碳排放在哪里被决定？不在仓库，也不在末端电动车上，而在<strong>承运方式、运输模式与路由选择</strong>这三层决策被锁定的那一刻。同一件 1.2 kg 的包裹从深圳到柏林，走航空直发与走中欧班列再落地配送，承运方算出的每件碳强度可以差出一到两个数量级。绿色配送选项工程要做的，是<strong>在订单履约链路里植入一个可比较、可解释、可核验的低碳选项层</strong>——把物理上不同的运输方案翻译成同一套碳强度口径，让消费者在结账页做出选择，让商家在时效与排放之间权衡，也让平台在履约后用真实承运数据核对当初的估算。估算方法与因子逻辑属于第一章（<a href=\"../carbon-accounting-methodology/\">碳排放估算方法学</a>），本章只消费其产出的碳强度值：分类第一维度是<strong>减碳作用层级</strong>（运输/包装/末端交付），第二维度是<strong>可核验性</strong>（减碳量能否被承运方事后用能源或燃料数据证实），第三维度是<strong>可分离性</strong>（订单级独立选择，还是与整体路由绑定）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>选项族</th>\n<th>减碳作用层</th>\n<th>可核验性</th>\n<th>典型适用边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>模式转换（空运→陆运/海运/铁路）</td>\n<td>干线运输</td>\n<td>高（燃料账单可核）</td>\n<td>时效可放宽、非急件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运输工具电气化（EV/电动货车）</td>\n<td>末端与支线</td>\n<td>高（电网因子 × 里程）</td>\n<td>城区配送、有充电调度能力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>货运自行车与微出行（cargo bike）</td>\n<td>末端最后一公里</td>\n<td>高（零尾气、人力为主）</td>\n<td>高密度城区、小件、&lt;20 kg</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>路由整合与拼车（consolidation）</td>\n<td>运输效率</td>\n<td>中（装载率模型）</td>\n<td>可等待的合并发货</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>包装减量与循环包装</td>\n<td>包装物</td>\n<td>中高（材料因子）</td>\n<td>可回收容器、逆向物流闭环</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自提点与智能柜（PUDO / locker）</td>\n<td>末端交付</td>\n<td>中（避免失败的二次配送）</td>\n<td>有自提网络覆盖的城区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高效船期与慢速航行（slow steaming）</td>\n<td>海运干线</td>\n<td>中（航速-油耗曲线）</td>\n<td>海运整柜、交期宽裕</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[订单履约链路] --&gt; B[干线运输]&#10;  A --&gt; C[支线分拨]&#10;  A --&gt; D[末端配送]&#10;  A --&gt; E[包装物]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[模式转换&lt;br/&gt;空运→铁路/海运]&#10;  B --&gt; B2[高效船期&lt;br/&gt;slow steaming]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[运输工具电气化&lt;br/&gt;EV 干线]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[货运自行车&lt;br/&gt;cargo bike]&#10;  D --&gt; D2[自提点/智能柜&lt;br/&gt;PUDO]&#10;  D --&gt; D3[路由整合&lt;br/&gt;multi-stop]&#10;  E --&gt; E1[包装减量]&#10;  E --&gt; E2[循环包装]&#10;  B1 -.高减碳·低可核验.-&gt; V[可核验性层级]&#10;  D1 -.高减碳·高可核验.-&gt; V\">graph TD\n  A[订单履约链路] --&gt; B[干线运输]\n  A --&gt; C[支线分拨]\n  A --&gt; D[末端配送]\n  A --&gt; E[包装物]\n  B --&gt; B1[模式转换&lt;br/&gt;空运→铁路/海运]\n  B --&gt; B2[高效船期&lt;br/&gt;slow steaming]\n  C --&gt; C1[运输工具电气化&lt;br/&gt;EV 干线]\n  D --&gt; D1[货运自行车&lt;br/&gt;cargo bike]\n  D --&gt; D2[自提点/智能柜&lt;br/&gt;PUDO]\n  D --&gt; D3[路由整合&lt;br/&gt;multi-stop]\n  E --&gt; E1[包装减量]\n  E --&gt; E2[循环包装]\n  B1 -.高减碳·低可核验.-&gt; V[可核验性层级]\n  D1 -.高减碳·高可核验.-&gt; V</pre><p>图中揭示了一个工程上的关键结构：<strong>减碳幅度与可核验性往往不同步</strong>。模式转换通常减碳最多，但需等承运方月结账单才能确认真实减碳量；而末端电动车虽然单车减碳有限，却可以在配送完成后立刻用里程和电网因子算出。这是决定选项能否在结账页被「实时计算碳强度」的核心约束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"模式转换-从空运到铁路与海运的碳强度跃迁\">模式转换：从空运到铁路与海运的碳强度跃迁</h2><p>模式转换是所有绿色配送选项里碳强度落差最大的一类，根本原因在于<strong>单位周转量的能耗存在结构性量级差异</strong>。按英国政府 2025 年更新的《温室气体报告用转换因子》（UK Government GHG Conversion Factors for Company Reporting, 2025），货运每吨公里碳强度大约落在：航空货运约 0.6–1.0 kgCO₂e/t·km，重型柴油货车约 0.1 kgCO₂e/t·km，铁路货运约 0.02–0.03 kgCO₂e/t·km，集装箱海运约 0.01–0.02 kgCO₂e/t·km。具体取哪个因子以平台选择的口径为准。</p>\n<p>干线段碳强度会随重量与距离同时放大，因此模式转换<strong>不能被建模为「每单固定的减碳量」</strong>，而必须建模为同一订单在两种模式下碳强度之差：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta E = m \\cdot d \\cdot (f_{air} - f_{rail})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 为计费毛重（kg），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 为干线段距离（km），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{air}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{rail}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为两种模式的碳强度因子。关键是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span>：计费重量通常取实际毛重与体积重量（volumetric weight）的较大者，而体积重量换算系数在航空与陆运之间可能不同；若直接拿商品净重代入，会系统性低估减碳量。工程上必须在订单维度固化「用于碳计算的重量口径」。</p>\n<p>模式转换的适用边界是<strong>时效容忍度</strong>。空运改铁路的中欧线路门到门时效通常从 7–12 天变为 18–25 天，海运则可能 30–45 天，因此它只对非急件、预售或定制品、可提前备货的补货订单成立。工程上这类选项通常附带一个<strong>约定的交付窗口</strong>而非精确送达日期，避免把减碳选择转化为履约 KPI 的违约。此外还需检查<strong>回程装载率</strong>：若为改走铁路而安排空放车皮，整条链路碳强度可能反而更高，故选项必须携带「最小装载率假设」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"末端电动化与货运自行车-可核验性最高的一层\">末端电动化与货运自行车：可核验性最高的一层</h2><p>末端是<strong>唯一可以在订单级实时计算碳强度</strong>的环节，因为它的两个输入——配送里程与车辆能耗/电网因子——都可以在配送完成后立刻获得：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{last} = d \\cdot e \\cdot g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 为末端配送里程（km），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 为车辆能耗（kWh/km，电动轻卡通常 0.15–0.3 kWh/km，电动三轮车更低），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 为<strong>所在电网的碳强度因子</strong>（kWh 对应的 kgCO₂e）。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 最容易被误用：拿国家年均电网因子代入会掩盖区域差异——法国核电占比高、电网因子低，而以煤电为主的区域电网因子可达其数倍。工程上<strong>必须使用配送城市的区域电网因子或供电商实测因子</strong>，否则「电动车」在煤电区域可能并不比柴油车低碳。</p>\n<p>货运自行车（cargo bike）是末端里减碳强度最高的一种，因为基本消除了尾气排放，且单车在拥堵条件下的配送效率常高于货车。但它的适用边界很硬：<strong>载重、体积与配送密度</strong>。常见电动货运自行车有效载荷在 100–250 kg（含骑手），实际承运单件通常限制在 20–30 kg 以内；且要求配送半径较短（通常 5–10 km 内的网点覆盖）与高订单密度，否则骑手往返成本吞掉效率优势。工程上这类选项应绑定到<strong>特定配送网点或前置仓</strong>，只在收货地址落入该网点服务范围时可用。</p>\n<p>需要强调的是，末端电动化的减碳量在<strong>绝对数值上通常小于模式转换</strong>——一个城区 5 km 的末端段即使全部电动化，减排量往往只有几克到几十克 CO₂e/件；而同一订单从空运改铁路，减碳量可能是其几十倍。把末端电动化包装成「碳中和配送」而干线段仍走空运，是一种<strong>减碳错觉</strong>：正确的做法是让碳强度贡献<strong>分层可见</strong>，把干线、支线、末端分别列出。</p>\n<h2 id=\"路由整合-自提与包装-效率类与材料类选项\">路由整合、自提与包装：效率类与材料类选项</h2><p>路由整合（consolidation）的逻辑是<strong>用装载率换碳强度</strong>。两台半满的班车合并成一台满载的班车，单位包裹的碳强度近似减半：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{route} = \\frac{d \\cdot f_{veh}}{N_{parcels}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3435em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{veh}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是车辆每公里的碳强度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{parcels}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是实际装载的包裹数。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{parcels}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是<strong>事后才知道的实测值</strong>，所以路由整合选项在结账页只能用「历史平均装载率」给出估算，事后用实际值回填。这是典型的「估算-实测」两阶段模型，也是绿色配送选项与静态碳标签的根本区别：<strong>选项的碳强度是承诺值的估计，不是确定值。</strong></p>\n<p>自提点与智能柜（PUDO / parcel locker network）的减碳机制来自两处：把「多地址逐个配送」变成「单点集货后消费者自取」，以及<strong>消除配送失败导致的二次配送</strong>——一次失败的再配送几乎等于把该件的末端排放翻倍。故自提选项的减碳量高度依赖平台的历史配送成功率，工程上应建模为「一次成功配送」与「计划配送 + 概率加权的失败再配送」之差。</p>\n<p>包装减量与循环包装属于<strong>材料类减碳</strong>，碳强度来自材料生产阶段的隐含排放（embodied emissions）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{pack} = \\sum_i m_i \\cdot f_i - m_{reuse} \\cdot f_{reuse} \\cdot (n_{cycles} - 1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">cy</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>前项为一次性包装各材料的质量与因子之和，后项为循环包装多次周转后摊薄到单次的减排量。<strong>循环包装只有在闭环回收率足够高时才能摊薄碳排放</strong>：若回收率只有 30%，大量容器丢失后需补投新容器，摊薄效应会被抵消甚至反转，故循环包装选项必须与逆向物流能力绑定。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>选项</th>\n<th>减碳量级</th>\n<th>数据依赖</th>\n<th>是否可订单级实时计算</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>模式转换</td>\n<td>最大</td>\n<td>重量、距离、模式因子</td>\n<td>是（估算），否（实测）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>末端电动化</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>里程、能耗、区域电网因子</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>货运自行车</td>\n<td>小到中</td>\n<td>里程、载重、网点覆盖</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>路由整合</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>装载率、车辆因子</td>\n<td>否（依赖事后装载率）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自提点</td>\n<td>小到中</td>\n<td>配送成功率、区域统计</td>\n<td>是（概率加权）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>循环包装</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>材料因子、回收率、周转次数</td>\n<td>是（依赖假设）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"选项可用性与防漂绿边界\">选项可用性与防漂绿边界</h2><p>绿色配送选项在工程上的最后一道关卡是<strong>可用性判定与防漂绿</strong>。一个选项在数据模型上成立，不代表它对某个订单可用。可用性由四类条件共同决定，且<strong>必须在订单维度实时求值</strong>，而非作为商品或店铺的静态属性：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>物理可行性</strong>：模式转换需要目的国有可用的铁路/海运路由，货运自行车需要收货地址落入 bike 网点服务圈，自提点需要附近存在可用柜机。</li>\n<li><strong>库存与路由可行性</strong>：若订单已分配到特定前置仓与承运合同，临时切换模式可能违反承运协议或调拨计划。</li>\n<li><strong>时效承诺可行性</strong>：若订单已被承诺较短的交付窗口，模式转换选项必须被抑制，否则选项本身构成违约风险。</li>\n<li><strong>碳强度可计算性</strong>：若订单缺少重量、目的国、路由等必要字段，选项不能给出碳强度，应<strong>降级为不可用而非给出默认值</strong>——用填零或缺省因子算出的「减碳量」是漂绿。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>防漂绿的制度边界同样需要工程化。欧盟《绿色声明指令》（Empowering Consumers for the Green Transition Directive, EU 2023/2673）明确禁止仅依靠<strong>抵消（offsetting）<strong>来宣称产品达到碳中和，并要求成员国在 <strong>2026 年 9 月 27 日前</strong>转化为国内法并适用。这意味着声称「碳中和配送」的选项必须以</strong>实际减排</strong>为主要减碳来源，碳抵消凭证只能作为剩余排放的补充并清晰披露。<strong>碳强度必须分层展示减排量与抵消量，不允许合并成一句「本单已碳中和」</strong>；合格的选项还必须说明它减少的是哪一段运输的排放、用什么因子估算、承诺值与实测值如何对账。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>分类的第一维度是<strong>减碳作用层级</strong>（干线/支线/末端/包装），第二维度是<strong>可核验性</strong>，第三维度是<strong>可分离性</strong>；三者共同决定选项能否被工程实现。</li>\n<li><strong>模式转换</strong>碳强度落差最大（空运与铁路/海运差出一到两个数量级），但只能事后核验，且受时效与装载率约束。</li>\n<li><strong>末端电动化与货运自行车</strong>是唯一可订单级实时计算的环节，但减碳绝对量通常远小于模式转换；误用国家年均电网因子会掩盖区域差异，产生「电动但不低碳」的反例。</li>\n<li><strong>路由整合、自提与循环包装</strong>依赖装载率、配送成功率与回收率等事后或概率数据，属于「估算-实测」两阶段模型。</li>\n<li>选项可用性必须在订单维度实时求值（物理、路由、时效、可计算性四类条件），<strong>缺数据时降级为不可用而非给默认值</strong>。</li>\n<li>欧盟《绿色声明指令》（EU 2023/2673）禁止仅靠抵消宣称碳中和，选项必须<strong>分层展示减排量与抵消量</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"绿色配送选项分类与适用边界","id":"绿色配送选项分类与适用边界"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"模式转换：从空运到铁路与海运的碳强度跃迁","id":"模式转换-从空运到铁路与海运的碳强度跃迁"},{"level":2,"text":"末端电动化与货运自行车：可核验性最高的一层","id":"末端电动化与货运自行车-可核验性最高的一层"},{"level":2,"text":"路由整合、自提与包装：效率类与材料类选项","id":"路由整合-自提与包装-效率类与材料类选项"},{"level":2,"text":"选项可用性与防漂绿边界","id":"选项可用性与防漂绿边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"包裹级碳排计算与不确定度处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/carbon-neutral-green-shipping-estimation-options/carbon-accounting-methodology/parcel-level-calculation-uncertainty"},"next":{"title":"碳感知路由与承运商碳强度评分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/carbon-neutral-green-shipping-estimation-options/green-shipping-options/carbon-aware-routing-carrier-scoring"}}